The file `pele.kbc1` is a compiled bundle of the Pele renderer. Pele is
licensed under the MIT License, copyright (c) 2026 kepano. The bundle also
contains the "rotate-ccw" icon from Lucide, licensed under the ISC License,
copyright (c) 2026 Lucide Icons and Contributors.

The full license texts are shipped in:

- `LICENSES/PELE-MIT.txt`
- `LICENSES/LUCIDE-ISC.txt`

`LICENSES/CTXJS-MIT.txt` covers the CtxJS runtime dependency, which is not
bundled in this package.

